abstract: >-
  Code and frozen experimental records for specification-sensitivity studies
  of Arena-Hard LLM judges, including the original experiment and the
  October 2026 repeated factorial experiment. MIT applies to original code;
  DATA_SOURCES.md describes upstream material and experimental-record scope.
